  "description": "Minor material amendment (S.73) to vary condition no.2 (approved plans), seeking to allow changes to the design in pursuant to planning permission reference 182180FUL dated 14/01/2020 (as amended by ref. 201456VAR dated on 09.03.2021, and ref. 202815NMA dated 12.08.2020) for 'Redevelopment of the site to provide residential flats and ground floor commercial floor space (A1 use class) accommodated within a part eleven storey (fronting onto Broadway) and part fifteen storey (fronting onto Singapore Road) building, with associated amenity space, cycle and refuse storage, and connection to Green Man Lane district heating centre (following demolition of buildings on site).' Variation seeks alterations to the boundary wall position of the proposed building to provide gap between 90-94 and 104-110 Broadway; alterations to the ground floor layout and entrance to Singapore Rd; replacement of 2 1-bed dwellings with 2-bed dwellings; and minor alterations to some internal courtyard windows, balconies and privacy screens.",
